{
  "$comment": [
    "Shared test vectors for the Ethiopian calendar and clock.",
    "",
    "Both engines read this one file: src/lib/ethiopian-calendar.test.ts (TypeScript)",
    "and admin/tests/Unit/EthiopianDateTest.php (PHP). If either implementation",
    "drifts, one of the two suites fails on the same vector — which is the point of",
    "keeping the file outside both trees. Add vectors here, never in one language only.",
    "",
    "The 2091/2092/2093 entries pin the behaviour across Gregorian 2100, which is not",
    "a leap year while Ethiopian 2092 is a full 365-day year starting on 12 September."
  ],
